# game/week1.rpy:13
translate indonesian week1_start_4eafbe45:

    # n "Your body comes back to those buildings. It was a breath of fresh air after a week of the MPLS event had finally ended."
    n  "Langkah kakimu kembali membawamu ke gedung-gedung megah ini. Rasanya begitu melegakan setelah seminggu penuh kegiatan MPLS akhirnya usai."

# game/week1.rpy:14
translate indonesian week1_start_b7396d4a:

    # n "People are already chattering and talking about the class arrangements after it came out."
    n  "Para siswa sudah ramai bercengkerama, membicarakan pembagian kelas yang baru saja diumumkan."

# game/week1.rpy:15
translate indonesian week1_start_fb4ca9d5:

    # n "Your heart thumps as you finally reach your class."
    n  "Jantungmu berdebar saat akhirnya langkahmu tiba di depan pintu kelas barumu."

# game/week1.rpy:22
translate indonesian week1_start_695e7a05:

    # n "The loud hum of the air conditioner fills the room, making the walls feel chill and stiff as your eyes wander around."
    n  "Dengung pendingin ruangan memenuhi seisi ruangan, membuat dinding-dinding terasa dingin dan kaku saat matamu memandang berkeliling."

# game/week1.rpy:23
translate indonesian week1_start_67089bcd:

    # n "The atmosphere in the classroom is uneasy, with everyone looking tense and lost in their own thoughts."
    n  "Suasana kelas terasa agak tegang, semua orang tampak canggung dan tenggelam dalam pikiran masing-masing."

# game/week1.rpy:24
translate indonesian week1_start_63f683e9:

    # n "You step into the room, inhaling an unfamiliar scent. After examining a few desks, you finally choose to sit down."
    n  "Kamu melangkah masuk, menghirup aroma ruangan yang masih asing. Setelah memperhatikan beberapa bangku yang kosong, akhirnya kamu memilih tempat duduk."

# game/week1.rpy:28
translate indonesian week1_start_9a59e30b:

    # n "You take a seat in the front row, right under the view of the blackboard."
    n  "Kamu memilih duduk di barisan depan, tepat di bawah pandangan papan tulis."

# game/week1.rpy:30
translate indonesian week1_start_eec9229b:

    # n "You settle into a desk in the middle row, surrounded by the chatter of your peers."
    n  "Kamu mengambil bangku di barisan tengah, dikelilingi riuh obrolan teman-teman sekelasmu."

# game/week1.rpy:32
translate indonesian week1_start_b88c7c07:

    # n "You choose a desk near the back corner, where you can observe the whole room."
    n  "Kamu memilih bangku di sudut belakang, tempat di mana kamu bisa mengamati seluruh sudut kelas."

# game/week1.rpy:34
translate indonesian week1_start_5608cd16:

    # n "A voice catches your attention, its familiar tone ringing in your ears."
    n  "Sebuah suara tiba-tiba menarik perhatianmu, nadanya yang familier terngiang di telingamu."

# game/week1.rpy:35
translate indonesian week1_start_d447134c:

    # n "You turn to see the same brown hair that you noticed during the MPLS event. Those sunset-orange eyes are already etched in your memory."
    n  "Kamu menoleh dan mendapati helaian rambut cokelat yang sama seperti saat kegiatan MPLS kemarin. Sepasang mata beriris oranye senja itu sudah terpatri jelas di ingatanmu."

# game/week1.rpy:38
translate indonesian week1_start_3d710289:

    # trida "Hey!"
    trida  "Hai!"

# game/week1.rpy:39
translate indonesian week1_start_db05c198:

    # trida "Sooo… we're in the same class, huh?"
    trida  "Jaaadi… kita beneran sekelas ya?"

# game/week1.rpy:41
translate indonesian week1_start_3d1e54eb:

    # n "They smile, revealing a grin and teeth you've never seen before."
    n  "Ia tersenyum, memperlihatkan cengiran dan deretan gigi yang belum pernah kamu lihat sebelumnya."

# game/week1.rpy:42
translate indonesian week1_start_c20ebb30:

    # n "Your memory of them being all awkward has changed to someone who is maybe more confident and bright."
    n  "Ingatanmu tentang dirinya yang serba canggung kini berganti menjadi sosok yang tampak lebih ceria dan percaya diri."

# game/week1.rpy:43
translate indonesian week1_start_2a5981e3:

    # trida "Wow, what a coincidence!"
    trida  "Wah, kebetulan banget ya!"

# game/week1.rpy:45
translate indonesian week1_start_e79ff7f0:

    # n "You were about to respond when the sound of footsteps made you pause."
    n  "Kamu baru saja hendak membalas saat suara derap langkah kaki membuatmu terdiam."

# game/week1.rpy:46
translate indonesian week1_start_f2185f7f:

    # n "The figure you recognised as your homeroom teacher entered the classroom."
    n  "Sosok yang kamu kenali sebagai wali kelasmu melangkah masuk ke dalam kelas."

# game/week1.rpy:48
translate indonesian week1_start_9a609b15:

    # teacher "Sit down, everyone."
    teacher  "Duduk semuanya."

# game/week1.rpy:49
translate indonesian week1_start_e2aae669:

    # n "The sound of scraping chairs and the clattering of desks shattered the lingering quiet, creating an echo that bounced off the walls."
    n  "Suara derit kursi yang digeser dan bunyi meja yang beradu memecah keheningan yang tersisa, menciptakan gema yang memantul di dinding."

# game/week1.rpy:50
translate indonesian week1_start_b0085b78:

    # n "A few seats were occupied, their occupants shifting restlessly as they settled in. You glanced over at Trida, who remained poised beside your table."
    n  "Beberapa bangku mulai terisi, para penghuninya bergerak gelisah saat menyesuaikan posisi duduk. Kamu melirik ke arah Trida yang masih berdiri tegak di samping mejamu."

# game/week1.rpy:53
translate indonesian week1_start_2fdf832f:

    # trida "That was the teacher, wasn't it!"
    trida  "Itu gurunya udah masuk kan ya?!"

# game/week1.rpy:54
translate indonesian week1_start_91238d07:

    # n "They shot a glance your way, their eyes wide with urgency and a hint of panic."
    n  "Ia melirik ke arahmu, matanya membelalak panik dengan sedikit rasa cemas."

# game/week1.rpy:55
translate indonesian week1_start_215051b2:

    # trida "Mind if I sit next to you?"
    trida  "Boleh nggak aku duduk di sebelahmu?"

# game/week1.rpy:60
translate indonesian week1_start_41633e9a:

    # p "Yeah, sure!"
    p  "Iya, boleh banget!"

# game/week1.rpy:62
translate indonesian week1_start_e0f267d7:

    # trida "Really? Thank you!"
    trida  "Beneran?! Makasih banyak ya!"

# game/week1.rpy:63
translate indonesian week1_start_c82bae6a:

    # n "You nodded eagerly as Trida hurried to take a seat at the desk next to you."
    n  "Kamu mengangguk mantap saat Trida bergegas menarik kursi dan duduk di bangku tepat di sebelahmu."

# game/week1.rpy:64
translate indonesian week1_start_dc4f6643:

    # n "They looked at you with a wide, cheerful smile, just like a kid who's just been given a delicious piece of candy!"
    n  "Ia menatapmu dengan senyum lebar penuh binar bahagia, persis seperti anak kecil yang baru saja dihadiahi permen lezat!"

# game/week1.rpy:65
translate indonesian week1_start_6d02bb9f:

    # trida "Thank you so much, I owe you one."
    trida  "Makasih banyak ya, aku berutang budi nih sama kamu."

# game/week1.rpy:66
translate indonesian week1_start_7ce6858d:

    # n "Their words rushed out with a compassionate tone. You smiled back just as the teacher cleared his throat."
    n  "Ucapannya meluncur cepat dengan nada yang tulus. Kamu membalas senyumnya tepat saat guru di depan berdeham pelan."

# game/week1.rpy:67
translate indonesian week1_start_b6a6ca9f:

    # n "You sneak another look at Trida, and your eyes meet for a fleeting moment."
    n  "Kamu mencuri pandang lagi ke arah Trida, dan tatapan kalian bertemu sejenak."

# game/week1.rpy:68
translate indonesian week1_start_a04b2f4c:

    # n "A spark of recognition passes between you, igniting a warm, tingling sensation that travels all the way from your toes to the top of your head."
    n  "Percikan kehangatan mengalir di antara kalian, menimbulkan sensasi geli yang menjalar dari ujung kaki hingga ke ujung kepala."

# game/week1.rpy:69
translate indonesian week1_start_c4850f97:

    # n "It's as if tiny fireworks are bursting in your mind, each one illuminating the thrill of the moment."
    n  "Rasanya bagaikan kembang api mungil meletup indah di benakmu, menyinari debar menyenangkan di momen itu."

# game/week1.rpy:73
translate indonesian week1_start_a083a4ce:

    # p "Uh, I don't know… Sorry, I think someone's already sitting there."
    p  "Eh, gimana ya… Maaf, kayaknya bangku ini udah ada yang nempatin deh."

# game/week1.rpy:75
translate indonesian week1_start_042ae56f:

    # n "You bit your lip, a nervous habit that betrayed your anxious thoughts."
    n  "Kamu menggigit bibir bawahmu, kebiasaan gugup yang membocorkan rasa cemasmu."

# game/week1.rpy:76
translate indonesian week1_start_d9a54cbc:

    # n "Trida's eyes dimmed, a poignant reflection of their sadness, as they tried to play it cool and looked for other remaining seats."
    n  "Sorot mata Trida seketika meredup, menyiratkan rasa kecewa saat ia berusaha bersikap tenang dan mencari bangku lain yang tersisa."

# game/week1.rpy:77
translate indonesian week1_start_4b220c3b:

    # n "But the teacher had already cleared his throat, making them panic as they still sat down at the desk next to you."
    n  "Namun sang guru sudah keburu berdeham, membuatnya panik hingga akhirnya tetap duduk terpaksa di bangku sebelahmu."

# game/week1.rpy:78
translate indonesian week1_start_6878188a:

    # trida "I didn't have time, I'm sorry…"
    trida  "Maaf ya, tadi aku udah nggak sempat nyari tempat lain…"

# game/week1.rpy:79
translate indonesian week1_start_d328a50e:

    # n "They said with a wry smile, disappointment evident on their face."
    n  "Ucapnya dengan senyum kecut, kekecewaan tampak jelas di raut wajahnya."

# game/week1.rpy:81
translate indonesian week1_start_d204ef6a:

    # teacher "Is everyone here today?"
    teacher  "Apakah semuanya sudah hadir hari ini?"

# game/week1.rpy:82
translate indonesian week1_start_fd3ccc45:

    # n "A noticeable silence fell over the room as the students refrained from answering."
    n  "Keheningan melanda seisi kelas saat para siswa menahan diri untuk tidak bersuara."

# game/week1.rpy:83
translate indonesian week1_start_60e5be0f:

    # teacher "I'll check your attendance first, okay?"
    teacher  "Bapak cek kehadirannya dulu ya."

# game/week1.rpy:85
translate indonesian week1_start_abd2a5a7:

    # n "He then called out each student's name one by one, asking for their nickname."
    n  "Beliau lalu memanggil nama siswa satu per satu, menanyakan nama panggilan masing-masing."

# game/week1.rpy:86
translate indonesian week1_start_9a0d7b5c:

    # n "When it was your turn, you stood up to explain your nickname and where you were from."
    n  "Saat giliranmu tiba, kamu berdiri dan memperkenalkan nama panggilan serta asal daerahmu."

# game/week1.rpy:87
translate indonesian week1_start_1b2ada70:

    # n "After attendance was taken, he outlined the classroom rules, teaching philosophy, and the importance of interactive learning."
    n  "Setelah absensi selesai, beliau memaparkan tata tertib kelas, metode pengajaran, serta pentingnya pembelajaran interaktif."

# game/week1.rpy:89
translate indonesian week1_start_21a28a19:

    # teacher "It's all from me, you can take a break now. Gather here again later, as I will provide a subtle overview of our curriculum and materials."
    teacher  "Sekian dari Bapak, sekarang kalian boleh istirahat dulu. Nanti kumpul lagi di sini, karena Bapak akan memberikan gambaran singkat mengenai kurikulum dan materi kita."

# game/week1.rpy:92
translate indonesian week1_start_6df30541:

    # n "Your homeroom teacher takes a walk out of the class, leaving you sitting there with exhaled breath."
    n  "Wali kelasmu melangkah keluar dari kelas, meninggalkanmu yang menghela napas panjang di bangkumu."

# game/week1.rpy:94
translate indonesian week1_start_1512f66c:

    # p "Where should I go now?"
    p  "Mau ke mana ya sekarang?"

# game/week1.rpy:111
translate indonesian week1_grapos_cfb51fe3:

    # p "Maybe I should walk around for a bit."
    p  "Mungkin jalan-jalan keliling sekolah bentar seru juga."

# game/week1.rpy:112
translate indonesian week1_grapos_7845a09d:

    # n "As you glance around the room, you realise that several students have already slipped out. With a sense of urgency, you step out into the fresh air."
    n  "Melihat sekeliling, kamu sadar beberapa siswa sudah berhamburan keluar. Dengan langkah mantap, kamu melangkah keluar menghirup udara segar."

# game/week1.rpy:118
translate indonesian week1_grapos_ef59b011:

    # n "As you walk along the familiar trail, you find yourself arriving at the open field where you participated in MPLS not long ago."
    n  "Menyusuri jalan setapak yang sudah tak asing, kamu mendapati dirimu tiba di lapangan terbuka tempat kamu mengikuti MPLS tempo hari."

# game/week1.rpy:119
translate indonesian week1_grapos_18c12281:

    # n "In the distance, the building marked 'Grapos' looms, its weathered façade a testament to the years that have passed. Tall grasses sway gently in the breeze."
    n  "Di kejauhan, gedung bertuliskan 'Grapos' tampak menjulang kokoh, fasad tuanya menjadi saksi bisu perjalanan waktu. Ilalang tinggi bergoyang lembut diterpa semilir angin."

# game/week1.rpy:122
translate indonesian week1_grapos_d296cfa5:

    # radit "Hi, [player_name]."
    radit  "Halo, [player_name]."

# game/week1.rpy:123
translate indonesian week1_grapos_85361435:

    # n "You turn around when you hear your name called. A figure you're already familiar with walks toward you casually, giving your shoulder a gentle tap."
    n  "Kamu berbalik saat mendengar namamu dipanggil. Sosok yang sudah familier berjalan santai menghampirimu, menepuk ringan pundakmu."

# game/week1.rpy:124
translate indonesian week1_grapos_cc534899:

    # p "…?"
    p  "…?"

# game/week1.rpy:125
translate indonesian week1_grapos_5ff3ea08:

    # n "You raise both eyebrows while he lets out a small chuckle."
    n  "Kamu mengangkat kedua alismu sementara ia terkekeh pelan."

# game/week1.rpy:126
translate indonesian week1_grapos_8ca581d9:

    # radit "So you don't remember my name now? I know you used to trip over things, but do you also do that with your memories?"
    radit  "Masa udah lupa sama namaku? Aku tahu kamu sering kesandung sesuatu, tapi ingatanmu jangan ikutan kesandung dong."

# game/week1.rpy:127
translate indonesian week1_grapos_4fd19194:

    # radit "We are classmates now, so care to get along, mate?"
    radit  "Sekarang kita sekelas lho, jadi… mau akrab kan, sobat?"

# game/week1.rpy:133
translate indonesian week1_grapos_8ff2926f:

    # n "Radit looked at you with an amused expression as he let out a small scoff, placing one hand in his pocket."
    n  "Radit menatapmu dengan raut geli seraya mendengus pelan, menyelipkan sebelah tangannya ke saku celana."

# game/week1.rpy:134
translate indonesian week1_grapos_7d5b09bc:

    # radit "Straight to negotiation, huh? Fair enough."
    radit  "Langsung to the point ke negosiasi ya? Boleh juga."

# game/week1.rpy:136
translate indonesian week1_grapos_9a0247f7:

    # radit "Deal. But don't complain when I take the better snacks."
    radit  "Oke, deal. Tapi jangan protes kalau aku yang ngambil camilan yang lebih enak ya."

# game/week1.rpy:141
translate indonesian week1_grapos_b7be3c59:

    # n "Radit tilted his head as his calm eyes glanced straight towards you."
    n  "Radit memiringkan kepalanya, matanya yang tenang menatap lurus ke arahmu."

# game/week1.rpy:142
translate indonesian week1_grapos_cebc8c80:

    # radit "That's… a pretty low standard."
    radit  "Standar yang… cukup rendah ya."

# game/week1.rpy:144
translate indonesian week1_grapos_dfbe9f2e:

    # n "After a pause, a small chuckle slips from his lips."
    n  "Setelah terdiam sejenak, tawa renyah meluncur pelan dari bibirnya."

# game/week1.rpy:145
translate indonesian week1_grapos_a511b588:

    # radit "But I'll take it. Peaceful is a good start."
    radit  "Tapi boleh lah. Hidup damai itu awal yang bagus."

# game/week1.rpy:150
translate indonesian week1_grapos_fe4f4d2b:

    # n "There was a brief silence before you saw him nod lightly, placing a smirk on his lips."
    n  "Hening sejenak sebelum kamu melihatnya mengangguk pelan, menyunggingkan seringai tipis di bibirnya."

# game/week1.rpy:151
translate indonesian week1_grapos_921ca82d:

    # radit "Guess we're stuck with each other then."
    radit  "Berarti kita bakal sering barengan nih ke depannya."

# game/week1.rpy:153
translate indonesian week1_grapos_b55c1cad:

    # p "By the way, I think we should head back now."
    p  "Ngomong-ngomong, kayaknya kita harus balik ke kelas sekarang deh."

# game/week1.rpy:154
translate indonesian week1_grapos_fb2e22d1:

    # n "You gestured with your thumbs on the way to class. Both of you walked slowly side by side back to the room and sat in your seats."
    n  "Kamu mengacungkan jempol ke arah kelas. Kalian berdua berjalan santai berdampingan kembali ke ruangan dan duduk di bangku masing-masing."

# game/week1.rpy:165
translate indonesian week1_rus_cfb51fe3:

    # p "Maybe I should walk around for a bit."
    p  "Mungkin jalan-jalan keliling sekolah bentar seru juga."

# game/week1.rpy:166
translate indonesian week1_rus_0ea6d8b3:

    # n "You rise from your seat and make your way toward the door, stepping out into the fresh air."
    n  "Kamu beranjak dari tempat dudukmu dan melangkah menuju pintu, keluar menghirup udara segar."

# game/week1.rpy:172
translate indonesian week1_rus_23e2c6ac:

    # n "The animation studio building looms impressively against the backdrop of a blazing sun, radiating heat that shimmers in the air."
    n  "Gedung studio animasi berdiri megah di bawah terik sinar matahari yang memancarkan hawa hangat di udara."

# game/week1.rpy:173
translate indonesian week1_rus_244745ab:

    # n "As you take in your surroundings, a sense of purpose washes over you."
    n  "Saat mengamati sekeliling, secercah semangat baru menyelimuti dirimu."

# game/week1.rpy:176
translate indonesian week1_rus_44651bd6:

    # chie "Hello there! How are you doing?"
    chie  "Halo halo! Apa kabar nih?"

# game/week1.rpy:177
translate indonesian week1_rus_71264f10:

    # n "A girl with long, flowing golden hair stands just two meters away, her bright smile lighting up her face."
    n  "Seorang gadis berambut pirang keemasan panjang berdiri hanya dua meter di depanmu, senyum cerahnya menyinari wajahnya."

# game/week1.rpy:178
translate indonesian week1_rus_7f020a84:

    # n "In a burst of energy, she takes both your hands and shakes them enthusiastically."
    n  "Penuh energi, ia langsung meraih kedua tanganmu dan mengguncangnya dengan antusias."

# game/week1.rpy:179
translate indonesian week1_rus_a7c9b4a8:

    # chie "You haven't forgotten me, have you… I'm Chie, you know, Chie!"
    chie  "Kamu nggak lupa kan sama aku… Aku Chie lho, Chie!"

# game/week1.rpy:180
translate indonesian week1_rus_e32f0aee:

    # chie "Don't forget me too quickly, okay? I'm always busy with my internship, so I'm a little worried people might easily forget me..."
    chie  "Jangan gampang lupa ya! Soalnya aku sering sibuk magang proyek, jadi agak khawatir orang-orang gampang ngelupain aku..."

# game/week1.rpy:186
translate indonesian week1_rus_c6f9aec5:

    # n "Hearing that, her shoulders visibly relaxed, the tension melting away."
    n  "Mendengar jawabanmu, pundaknya tampak rileks, rasa cemasnya seketika mencair."

# game/week1.rpy:187
translate indonesian week1_rus_4123886d:

    # chie "Really? You do?"
    chie  "Beneran?! Kamu masih ingat?"

# game/week1.rpy:188
translate indonesian week1_rus_87b04b1d:

    # chie "Aaa, that makes me so happy! I was seriously overthinking it."
    chie  "Aaa, seneng banget dengernya! Sumpah tadi aku udah overthinking duluan."

# game/week1.rpy:189
translate indonesian week1_rus_26c3453f:

    # p "You don't have to worry about that. Sounds like you've been really busy, though."
    p  "Nggak usah khawatir soal itu kali. Tapi kedengarannya kamu sibuk banget ya?"

# game/week1.rpy:190
translate indonesian week1_rus_0657b958:

    # chie "Yeah… It's been kinda hectic lately as sophomores, but it's fun too. Also, if you need help or anything, you could still ask me!"
    chie  "Iya nih… Akhir-akhir ini agak hectic banget jadi anak kelas sebelas, tapi seru juga kok. Terus kalau kamu butuh bantuan apa-apa, tanya aja ke aku ya!"

# game/week1.rpy:195
translate indonesian week1_rus_068006dd:

    # chie "Yay!! I knew it!"
    chie  "Yeeay!! Tuh kan, bener!"

# game/week1.rpy:196
translate indonesian week1_rus_f4908064:

    # n "She lets out a delighted squeal, hopping on her heels like a playful rabbit."
    n  "Ia memekik girang, berjingkrak-jingkrak dengan tumitnya persis seperti kelinci yang lincah."

# game/week1.rpy:197
translate indonesian week1_rus_bfcebe34:

    # chie "See, I'm memorable, right?"
    chie  "Tuh kan, aku emang gampang diingat, ya nggak?"

# game/week1.rpy:198
translate indonesian week1_rus_4e1d6aed:

    # p "Yeah, you are. So… how's the internship going anyway?"
    p  "Iya, bener banget kok. Terus… gimana magangnya sejauh ini?"

# game/week1.rpy:199
translate indonesian week1_rus_927c365e:

    # chie "It's been kinda hectic lately, honestly… But don't worry, if you need help, you can still ask me!"
    chie  "Jujur akhir-akhir ini lumayan padat sih… Tapi tenang aja, kalau kamu butuh bantuan apa pun, bilang aja ke aku!"

# game/week1.rpy:204
translate indonesian week1_rus_e1997b9a:

    # chie "Oh! Yeah, I guess that makes me your senior, huh?"
    chie  "Oh! Iya juga ya, berarti aku ini seniormu dong?"

# game/week1.rpy:205
translate indonesian week1_rus_54ba405e:

    # chie "Don't worry, I'm a nice one! If you need help, you can totally ask me!"
    chie  "Tenang aja, aku senior yang baik kok! Kalau kamu butuh bantuan, kamu bisa banget ngandalin aku!"

# game/week1.rpy:207
translate indonesian week1_rus_2c57ad72:

    # p "Thank you for that, Chie. By the way, I think we should head back now."
    p  "Makasih banyak ya, Chie. Ngomong-ngomong, kayaknya kita harus balik ke kelas sekarang."

# game/week1.rpy:208
translate indonesian week1_rus_25c7e17c:

    # n "You gestured toward class, leaving her waving goodbye as you walked back and took your seat."
    n  "Kamu memberi isyarat ke arah kelas. Ia melambaikan tangan saat kamu melangkah kembali dan duduk di bangkumu."

# game/week1.rpy:220
translate indonesian week1_stay_cdbdf3a7:

    # p "Maybe I should just stay in here."
    p  "Kayaknya aku mendingan di kelas aja deh."

# game/week1.rpy:221
translate indonesian week1_stay_e3103420:

    # n "Half of the people in the room had already left. You sat there scrolling through your phone, passing the break time."
    n  "Sebagian besar teman sekelas sudah keluar ruangan. Kamu duduk santai sambil membuka ponsel, mengisi waktu istirahat."

# game/week1.rpy:237
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_bcd68c17:

    # n "The lights are cast through the window, making a faint glow in the classroom."
    n  "Cahaya matahari menembus jendela, menciptakan pendar hangat di dalam kelas."

# game/week1.rpy:238
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_b31642fc:

    # n "The sound of complete silence wafting through the class only reached your homeroom teacher, who was now introducing 3D Animation."
    n  "Keheningan yang melingkupi kelas terpecahkan saat wali kelasmu masuk kembali dan mulai memperkenalkan materi Animasi 3D."

# game/week1.rpy:241
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_d0eb664b:

    # teacher "3D animation takes digital objects and makes them come to life by creating the illusion they're moving through a three-dimensional space."
    teacher  "Animasi 3D mengambil objek digital dan membuatnya tampak hidup dengan menciptakan ilusi bahwa objek tersebut bergerak dalam ruang tiga dimensi."

# game/week1.rpy:242
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_3742c865:

    # teacher "These computer-generated objects appear on a two-dimensional screen, but are crafted to mimic the principles of a 3D world; they appear to move, turn, and rotate like real-world objects."
    teacher  "Objek-objek buatan komputer ini memang tampil di layar dua dimensi, namun dirancang mengikuti prinsip-prinsip dunia 3D; bisa bergerak, berputar, dan berotasi layaknya benda di dunia nyata."

# game/week1.rpy:247
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_520e7990:

    # n "Trida was still doodling through their notes, making scratch sketches with their tongue sticking out—a cat and a dog intertwining their hands together."
    n  "Trida masih asyik mencoret-coret buku catatannya, menggambar sketsa sambil menjulurkan lidahnya sedikit—gambar kucing dan anjing yang saling bergandengan tangan."

# game/week1.rpy:250
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_ee977a0f:

    # teacher "You there…"
    teacher  "Kamu yang di sana…"

# game/week1.rpy:251
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_6b6c00cf:

    # teacher "Are you still with us?"
    teacher  "Masih fokus sama pelajaran Bapak?"

# game/week1.rpy:253
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_08367f1f:

    # n "It was a sudden move that made everyone turn their attention to Trida."
    n  "Teguran tiba-tiba itu membuat seisi kelas langsung menolehkan pandangan ke arah Trida."

# game/week1.rpy:255
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_38d6a973:

    # trida "Oh-yes. Yes, sir!"
    trida  "Eh-iya. Iya, Pak!"

# game/week1.rpy:256
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_fa85c1bb:

    # teacher "Could you explain to me what 3D Animation does?"
    teacher  "Bisa tolong jelaskan ke Bapak, apa fungsi dari Animasi 3D?"

# game/week1.rpy:259
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_827962ac:

    # trida "It's…"
    trida  "Fungsinya…"

# game/week1.rpy:260
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_9fd14998:

    # n "They hesitated, their eyeballs rolling through the corners of the room before both of your gazes met."
    n  "Ia ragu-ragu, bola matanya melirik cemas ke sudut-sudut ruangan sebelum tatapan kalian berdua bertemu."

# game/week1.rpy:261
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_e2f516d0:

    # n "Their hair antenna is bouncing, looking like they are sending a telepathic message to help them."
    n  "Antena rambutnya tampak bergoyang-goyang, seolah sedang mengirimkan sinyal telepati meminta bantuanmu."

# game/week1.rpy:262
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_d5276080:

    # trida "So, 3D Animation is…"
    trida  "Jadi, Animasi 3D itu…"

# game/week1.rpy:267
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_e77adbdd:

    # p "3D animation makes digital objects look like they're moving in real 3D space, even though you're just seeing them on a flat screen."
    p  "Animasi 3D bikin objek digital kelihatan bergerak di ruang 3D nyata, meskipun kita cuma ngelihatnya di layar datar."

# game/week1.rpy:268
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_9cfd4ac7:

    # n "You whispered slowly to them, making them blink repeatedly before returning an awkward smile."
    n  "Kamu berbisik pelan ke arahnya. Trida mengerjapkan matanya berkali-kali sebelum membalas dengan senyum kikuk."

# game/week1.rpy:270
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_2b826bfe:

    # trida "3D animation is basically giving digital stuff a little life—like, 'go on, move around, spin a bit'."
    trida  "Animasi 3D itu intinya ngasih kehidupan ke benda digital—kayak, 'ayo gerak, muter sana-sini'."

# game/week1.rpy:271
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_34bcc980:

    # trida "So it looks like it's living in a real 3D world, even though it's just chilling on a flat screen."
    trida  "Biar kelihatan hidup di dunia 3D nyata, padahal aslinya cuma tampil di layar datar."

# game/week1.rpy:272
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_80ff661e:

    # teacher "That was the simplest one to say."
    teacher  "Penjelasan yang sangat sederhana dan tepat sasaran."

# game/week1.rpy:274
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_2e8841b2:

    # n "The teacher put on a slight smile before explaining more about the topic, leaving Trida to glance at you with a bright grin."
    n  "Pak guru menyunggingkan senyum tipis sebelum melanjutkan penjelasan, sementara Trida melirikmu dengan seringai cerah."

# game/week1.rpy:278
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_134cffe5:

    # n "They deliberately lean in to you."
    n  "Ia sengaja mencondongkan tubuhnya ke arahmu."

# game/week1.rpy:279
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_ff6d0b02:

    # trida "Thank you!"
    trida  "Makasih banyak ya!"

# game/week1.rpy:284
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_c5d3c352:

    # p "3D animation tells a story by making drawings move in a flat space, frame by frame, by hand or on a computer."
    p  "Animasi 3D itu bercerita lewat gambar yang digerakkan di bidang datar, frame demi frame, baik manual maupun komputer."

# game/week1.rpy:285
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_eafb9526:

    # n "You whispered slowly to them. Trida rotates their head to face the teacher."
    n  "Kamu berbisik pelan ke arahnya. Trida menolehkan kepalanya menghadap ke pak guru."

# game/week1.rpy:287
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_86f4802c:

    # trida "3D animation is like flipping through a bunch of drawings really fast, so they start moving and telling a story on a flat screen."
    trida  "Animasi 3D itu kayak membolak-balik segepok gambar dengan cepat, jadi gambarnya kelihatan bergerak dan bercerita di layar datar."

# game/week1.rpy:288
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_6cd110cf:

    # teacher "That was slightly incorrect. Those were 2D animation techniques."
    teacher  "Jawaban itu kurang tepat. Itu adalah prinsip dari teknik animasi 2D."

# game/week1.rpy:290
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_0a4365de:

    # n "The teacher explained more about the topic, leaving Trida to glance at you with a bitten lip and a defeated look."
    n  "Pak guru menjelaskan lebih lanjut materinya, meninggalkan Trida yang melirikmu sambil menggigit bibir dengan raut wajah pasrah."

# game/week1.rpy:291
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_3ba947f1:

    # trida "It's alright, don't be bothered by it…"
    trida  "Nggak apa-apa kok, jangan dipikirin ya…"

# game/week1.rpy:294
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_5ef516b7:

    # n "On that day, time seemed to race ahead. The teacher piled on lessons not far beyond what a beginner could handle."
    n  "Hari itu, waktu terasa bergulir begitu cepat. Pak guru memberikan materi dasar yang masih cukup mudah dipahami oleh pemula."

# game/week1.rpy:295
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_983174d0:

    # n "By midday, relief washed over you as the class finally drew to a close. People started packing their stuff into bags, and you did too."
    n  "Menjelang siang, rasa lega menyelimuti dirimu saat kelas akhirnya selesai. Teman-teman mulai merapikan barang-barang ke dalam tas, begitu pula dirimu."

# game/week1.rpy:297
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_eb1ed1b6:

    # n "You feel someone come up to your desk."
    n  "Kamu merasakan seseorang melangkah mendekati mejamu."

# game/week1.rpy:302
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_4c98ccb0:

    # trida "Hey, so… thanks for earlier."
    trida  "Hei, um… makasih ya buat yang tadi."

# game/week1.rpy:307
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_1309cae9:

    # p "It's not that much of a help tho!"
    p  "Bukan bantuan yang seberapa juga kok!"

# game/week1.rpy:310
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_70f32765:

    # p "That was not a big deal."
    p  "Bukan masalah besar kok, santai aja."

# game/week1.rpy:312
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_478ed0b2:

    # p "Don't bother it much…"
    p  "Nggak usah terlalu dipikirin…"

# game/week1.rpy:314
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_28369d4e:

    # trida "Well, you still helped me, whether it was correct or not, you still helped me."
    trida  "Yah, mau bener atau salah, kamu tetep udah berusaha bantuin aku tadi."

# game/week1.rpy:315
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_a77a0ad3:

    # n "Trida pressed closer, their warmth enveloping you like a cosy blanket, igniting an exhilarating spark in the air."
    n  "Trida berdiri semakin dekat, kehangatan dirinya menyelimutimu bagai selimut nyaman, memantik debar menyenangkan di udara."

# game/week1.rpy:316
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_4f3d9d6f:

    # trida "Actually, that was kind of funny, you know… About me being all distracted… and goofy, I guess?"
    trida  "Sebenernya tadi agak lucu sih… Waktu aku ketahuan ngelamun… konyol banget kan ya?"

# game/week1.rpy:317
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_ae948177:

    # p "Yeah, that was kind of hilarious."
    p  "Haha iya, tadi emang lumayan bikin ngakak sih."

# game/week1.rpy:318
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_9cc4b409:

    # n "Both of you burst into laughter, recalling the surprise pop quiz from today."
    n  "Kalian berdua tertawa lepas, mengenang momen kuis dadakan yang tak terduga tadi."

# game/week1.rpy:321
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_9d9fe852:

    # trida "Anyways, that tension earlier makes me crave an iced tea."
    trida  "Ngomong-ngomong, gara-gara tegang tadi, aku jadi pengen banget minum es teh nih."

# game/week1.rpy:323
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_c18282df:

    # n "Trida looks at the floor fidgeting with their tie, glancing from the corner of their eye waiting for your reaction."
    n  "Trida menatap lantai sambil memainkan dasinya, melirik dari sudut matanya menunggu reaksimu."

# game/week1.rpy:328
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_9b52a12e:

    # p "I mean, it's kind of hot today, so…"
    p  "Kebetulan hari ini emang agak gerah sih, jadi…"

# game/week1.rpy:331
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_8061cb5f:

    # p "Should we buy something to drink?"
    p  "Gimana kalau kita jajan minuman segar?"

# game/week1.rpy:334
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_57488d4f:

    # trida "Let's go buy it together!"
    trida  "Yuk, kita beli bareng-bareng!"

# game/week1.rpy:335
translate indonesian week1_back_to_class_48836047:

    # n "For a moment, you can feel Trida's hands gripping your wrist, pulling you enthusiastically toward the Teddy Cup stall."
    n  "Untuk sesaat, kamu merasakan genggaman tangan Trida di pergelangan tanganmu, menarikmu penuh semangat menuju stan Teddy Cup."

# game/week1.rpy:351
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_4f66b721:

    # n "The school was almost empty because most of the students had already gone home."
    n  "Area sekolah sudah mulai sepi karena sebagian besar siswa sudah pulang ke rumah."

# game/week1.rpy:352
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_407bda09:

    # n "You and Trida sat near the stall and ordered two cups of iced tea."
    n  "Kamu dan Trida duduk di dekat stan dan memesan dua gelas es teh manis dingin."

# game/week1.rpy:353
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_09e6ded7:

    # n "While waiting for the drinks, both of you began chatting about today's topics and discussing what the curriculum would be like for the next three years."
    n  "Sambil menunggu pesanan, kalian berdua asyik mengobrol tentang materi hari ini dan membicarakan kurikulum tiga tahun ke depan."

# game/week1.rpy:356
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_bcc55390:

    # trida "Not gonna lie, when they brought up the Final Assignment in twelfth grade? I was a little excited. I mean—how bad could it be?"
    trida  "Jujur ya, waktu tadi guru nyinggung soal Tugas Akhir di kelas dua belas? Aku malah agak excited lho. Maksudku—sesusah apa sih emangnya?"

# game/week1.rpy:360
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_70eb5d4d:

    # p "It could be worse than we thought."
    p  "Bisa jadi jauh lebih berat dari yang kita bayangin lho."

# game/week1.rpy:362
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_c022cc5e:

    # p "Maybe it was easier than we imagined?"
    p  "Mungkin malah lebih gampang dari dugaan kita?"

# game/week1.rpy:364
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_4a81127d:

    # p "I think it was still fifty-fifty for now."
    p  "Menurutku peluangnya masih fifty-fifty sih buat sekarang."

# game/week1.rpy:367
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_48dc89de:

    # n "The winds rustled around them, tousling their hair in a wild dance, while the crisp sound of leaves crunching underfoot filled the air."
    n  "Semilir angin berdesir di sekeliling kalian, menerbangkan helai rambut dalam tarian bebas, sementara suara gemersik dedaunan terdengar renyah."

# game/week1.rpy:368
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_67ed3881:

    # n "As Trida breathed out slowly, a serene softness washed over their expression, as if they were lost in a vivid daydream."
    n  "Saat Trida menghela napas perlahan, raut wajahnya tampak begitu tenang dan teduh, seolah sedang hanyut dalam lamunan yang indah."

# game/week1.rpy:370
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_401b0365:

    # trida "Well, however it is, I hoped we are on the same team."
    trida  "Yah, bagaimanapun nanti jalannya, aku berharap kita bisa satu tim."

# game/week1.rpy:371
translate indonesian week1_teddy_cup_a31aca14:

    # trida "I know it will be fun, with you."
    trida  "Pasti bakal seru banget kalau bareng kamu."

# game/week1.rpy:387
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_aaa5ba9d:

    # n "You just arrived in your room and let out a slow exhale."
    n  "Kamu baru saja tiba di kamarmu dan menghela napas perlahan."

# game/week1.rpy:388
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_d3b1d39a:

    # n "Your bags are resting on the chair while you lie back on the bed."
    n  "Tas sekolahmu tergeletak di kursi sementara kamu merebahkan tubuh di atas kasur yang empuk."

# game/week1.rpy:389
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_b22b0364:

    # n "The ceiling of your room feels emptier, but your chest is filled with joy from today's activities, mainly because you now have a friend."
    n  "Langit-langit kamarmu terasa lebih lapang, dan dadamu dipenuhi rasa hangat dari aktivitas hari ini, terutama karena sekarang kamu sudah punya teman."

# game/week1.rpy:390
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_1303d8bd:

    # n "Then it hits you—there's something you've been wanting to do once you start high school. Maybe it will help you earn some extra pocket money."
    n  "Lalu kamu teringat—ada sesuatu yang sudah lama ingin kamu coba begitu masuk SMK. Mungkin bisa buat nambah uang jajan sehari-hari."

# game/week1.rpy:392
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_b64f7ef3:

    # p "Yeah, I should get a part-time job."
    p  "Kayaknya seru juga kalau ambil kerja sambilan."

# game/week1.rpy:393
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_02aa3109:

    # p "But what should I do?"
    p  "Tapi kerjaan apa yang cocok ya?"

# game/week1.rpy:397
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_938e9f0b:

    # n "That sounds like easy money."
    n  "Kedengarannya gampang dan lumayan buat nambah uang jajan."

# game/week1.rpy:399
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_ae3c026a:

    # n "Maybe you'll enjoy the calm atmosphere."
    n  "Mungkin kamu bakal menikmati suasana kafe yang tenang dan nyaman."

# game/week1.rpy:401
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_f3a7ce94:

    # n "A creative outlet — could be fun."
    n  "Wadah yang pas buat menyalurkan kreativitas—pasti seru banget."

# game/week1.rpy:403
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_3290c273:

    # n "With a decision in mind, you close your eyes and let the exhaustion of the first week fade into sleep."
    n  "Dengan keputusan yang sudah mantap di kepala, kamu memejamkan mata dan membiarkan lelahnya minggu pertama larut ke dalam tidur lelap."

# game/week1.rpy:405
translate indonesian week1_bedroom_56e2ff2a:

    # n "Before you know it, another week at school begins..."
    n  "Tanpa terasa, minggu baru di sekolah pun segera dimulai..."

